{"ID":"20240206092940-qk0rgw5","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206092940-qk0rgw5","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206092940-qk0rgw5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206092951-ljmtxn0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206092944-xirqmxw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206092951-ljmtxn0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"仙茅","type":"doc","updated":"20240830115221"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206092951-ljmtxn0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206092951-ljmtxn0"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产两广地区及四川等地。\n【性状】\t干燥根茎为圆柱形，略弯曲，两端平，长310cm，直径38mm。表面棕褐色或黑褐色，粗糙，皱缩不平，有细密而不连续的横纹，并散布有不甚明显的细小圆点状皮孔。未去须根者，在根茎的一端常丛生两端细、中间粗的须根，长约3"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6cm，有极密的环状横纹，质轻而疏松，柔软而不易折断。根茎质坚脆，易折断，断面平坦，微带颗粒性 (经蒸过者略呈透明角质状)，皮部浅灰棕色或因糊化而呈红棕色，靠近中心处色较深。微有辛香气，味微苦辛。\n【性味】\t辛，热，有毒。\n【功效】\t温肾阳，壮筋骨。治阳萎精冷，小便失禁，崩漏，心腹冷痛，腰脚冷痹，痈疽，瘰疬，阳虚冷泻。阳痿精寒，腰膝风冷，筋骨痿痹等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240206092944-xirqmxw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206092944-xirqmxw","updated":"20240206092944"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206092944-thyjrg4.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709130628-ppryhd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709130628-ppryhd6","updated":"20240709130700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 437px;","style":"width: 427px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"仙茅"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/仙茅-20240709130628-drxpouq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 427px;\" parent-style=\"width: 437px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 273px;","style":"width: 263px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"仙茅 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/仙茅 1-20240709130700-ew6v5y1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 263px;\" parent-style=\"width: 273px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709131722-bs0txhl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709131722-bs0txhl","updated":"20240709132109"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 430px;","style":"width: 420px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"仙茅 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/仙茅 10-20240709131722-5mj52a3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 420px;\" parent-style=\"width: 430px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 429px;","style":"width: 419px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"仙茅 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/仙茅 11-20240709132109-tqxzs49.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 419px;\" parent-style=\"width: 429px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709130744-3hi787t","Type":"No